{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024820/extras/20102c02530fcea001f726a580b195e5.poster.avif?t=1758527199\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024820/extras/20102c02530fcea001f726a580b195e5.webm?t=1758527199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024820/extras/20102c02530fcea001f726a580b195e5.mp4?t=1758527199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RESEED</strong> is a precision platformer that tests both your skill and your memory. Your goal: guide each seed safely to the end of the level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The twist? While planning your route, the traps are hidden. You will need to remember their locations from memory and plan a safe path if you want the seed to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024820/extras/982b37896bd185e102209ecdb00eee0d.webp?t=1758527199\" width=616 height=44 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorize the location of traps and plan a safe route to guide each seed safely to the end of the level. Precision and memory are your best tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024820/extras/29340acb0085bb57106776adeae25640.poster.avif?t=1758527199\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024820/extras/29340acb0085bb57106776adeae25640.webm?t=1758527199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024820/extras/29340acb0085bb57106776adeae25640.mp4?t=1758527199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024820/extras/ee6b133af99ab81f6fc6cbb5b48bdaf3.webp?t=1758527199\" width=616 height=44 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success won\u2019t come on your first try. Learn from each mistake, refine your memory, and perfect your route as levels grow increasingly complex with new traps and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024820/extras/3a38e273cef9658158d2d822fb9a9b47.webp?t=1758527199\" width=616 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect golden seeds throughout the levels to unlock special missions and discover unique gameplay twists that will put your skills to test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024820/extras/c05e175dde6f2cee71280c38279d24c2.webp?t=1758527199\" width=616 height=44 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue every seed and bring them back to your ship to complete your mission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024820/extras/b368d6682e043d5e6d8df8d64d803212.poster.avif?t=1758527199\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024820/extras/b368d6682e043d5e6d8df8d64d803212.webm?t=1758527199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024820/extras/b368d6682e043d5e6d8df8d64d803212.mp4?t=1758527199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The RESEED demo includes four missions, each with multiple levels, that offer a glimpse into some of the unique mechanics you'll find in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles are available throughout the demo; collecting them all will unlock a special mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024820/extras/3ccb92ea18cd893665ba514306f4d188.poster.avif?t=1758527199\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024820/extras/3ccb92ea18cd893665ba514306f4d188.apng?t=1758527199\" class=\"bb_img\" width=115 height=137 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024820?t=1758527199","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024820/c7b5aa7afb2d34507c8573e9c48279a625b88d4c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758527199","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024820/2cf1cbc344f46eb67a985c3075497d67e19484f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758527199","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024820/2cf1cbc344f46eb67a985c3075497d67e19484f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758527199","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\